<title>USA: Amoco Corp Q1 net off.</title>
<headline>Amoco Corp Q1 net off.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.36		    $1.47</p>
<p> Net			674,000		  728,000</p>
<p> Revs		   9,002,000		8,214,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 495,287		  496,677</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q1 net includes one-time gain of $56 million.  </p>
<p>Excluding that one-time gain, 1996 Q1 net was $672 million, or $1.36 per share.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
